text='# pci_signal_trading_v1 — exploratory robustness\n\nNo Q-learning or new pooled MLE. Six real cells were executed (including their pilot folds),586→592. Null cells do not add real trials. Old PartC,source outputs and sealed DSR remain unchanged.\n\n'+'\n'.join(t)+'\n\nNet/gross and turnover are equal means of22calendar-year sums, not252×pooleddailymean. All CIs are descriptive shared year-block bootstrap,5000draws,seed20261026,percentile95%; one-sidedp=count(draw<=0)/5000. NoHolm or newgo/no-go decision. Full fields and p values: results.csv. Yearly source row keys and baseline paths: yearly.csv. Gross is the same5bps trades beforeK2cost; no0bps re-selection or additional0bps cells.\n\n'
