text+='## Optional null\n\nAL_K uses savedCLEAN_null r0 signals and parameters. Execution retains the original G0 N2 return-mark convention,including its unflipped alpha carry; this is explicitly labelled CLEAN_null_r0_original_N2_marks in yearly.csv. It is not a newly constructed fully flipped tradable hedge return. The real-minus-null figures are descriptive and conditional on that saved/source convention. No null signal or parameter was newly fitted/generated.\n\n'
text+='## Pilot and environment\n\nSee pilot_report.md. Stop below2GiB free; one process,one BLAS thread,nice10. No packages installed. Pytest uses the already restored verified329-bytepy shim and disables optional capture/debugging plugins because the existing readline extension crashes when imported. Tests retain no pytest cache. All caches and outputs stay here.\n\n'
